Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.99,0:02:19.99,Note,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Sign: Culture Festival {文化祭 bunkasai = Culture/Art festival}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:42.47,Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnChalk\b0\blur1\fs30\fsp0.5\c&H9A839A&\pos(658,583)}Kaga Rin {かが　りん}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:28.36,Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnChalk\blur1\b0\fs35\fsp0.5\c&H9CAEA4&\pos(769,550)}Nitani Kouki
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.43,0:00:09.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:10.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you bite your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:11.99,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:17.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Feels like my tooth is moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:18.95,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:20.95,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:24.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, the new adult tooth will grow from underneath.{Permanent tooth}{"Adult tooth" is the right term here-AvidElite}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:26.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.82,0:00:29.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want me to prepare a bowl of porridge for you? {okayu お粥 = rice porridge/congee}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.52,0:00:32.67,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No, it'll be fine if I just eat slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:24.87,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Ah, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.87,0:02:27.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.14,0:02:34.84,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,W-What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.91,0:02:38.71,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Look, that's my drawing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:46.59,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It's always your father who comes from your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.59,0:02:49.37,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yup, but he's not my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.37,0:02:51.10,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Really? He's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:55.87,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:03:00.45,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Hey hey, Rin-chan is the best in class B at drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.03,0:03:05.55,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure you can become a manga artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.55,0:03:07.33,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What? It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:09.39,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.39,0:03:10.50,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.45,0:03:17.30,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Papa! {\alpha&FFFFFF&}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:19.22,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Papa! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:25.89,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:29.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Such elegance, and style; he's a father? {Why does Daikichi say "Papa"? Is it something having to do with the way Sayaka addresses her? Please check and change. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:31.11,Default,Girls,0000,0000,0000,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.11,0:03:32.25,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:33.97,Default-Alt,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,He's really tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:37.23,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Sayaka-chan's father is the same age as you, 31 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.23,0:03:39.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:41.43,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.43,0:03:43.36,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,What a pleasant coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:48.99,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Papa is a model.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:50.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What? That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.77,0:03:52.75,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:56.71,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Only for a few years, back when I was younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.59,0:04:02.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I think I recall seeing you in my company's item catalogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.49,0:04:05.15,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:09.56,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me, can you tell me your company's name, if it's fine with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.42,0:04:13.92,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,That's probably me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:15.60,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I was under your company's care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:17.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What a cheerful person.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:17.77,Default-Alt,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,How nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:20.91,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, I'm working as a manager at the same company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.91,0:04:22.91,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:24.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:28.29,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,The hours and salary for a model isn't stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.29,0:04:30.95,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,So I stopped when my daughter was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.41,0:04:38.17,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}At the same time, I was always drinking and complaining about work.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:39.92,Default,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Micchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:43.88,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Nabe-chin, long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:47.53,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,He was my classmate. We both live around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.53,0:04:51.08,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,His kid is also here in class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:54.21,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,This is Rin-chan's father, Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:55.85,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,He's the same age as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.85,0:04:58.06,Default,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:05:00.18,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:04.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All these people have become capable of protecting children.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.78,0:05:05.99,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.16,0:05:13.57,Default,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,My family runs a meat stall.\N It's just at the end of the shopping district.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:16.42,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Rin and I frequently go there to buy croquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:19.01,Default,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Really? I'm really glad to hear that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.01,0:05:20.11,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Me too, I also buy it from there. {Maybe change to "Me too, me too" -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.11,0:05:22.76,Default,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:32.55,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I've made some dad-friends.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.98,0:05:41.10,Default,Child,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.10,0:05:44.31,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,How's that? Very tall, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:45.32,Default-Alt,Child,0000,0000,0000,,It's so tall, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:05.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,In a way, this is a much bigger world.{hiroi 広い = vast; 寛い = broad}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:12.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:14.47,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:17.03,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's gotten rather cold, all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.03,0:06:20.96,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, and all the children seem to have gone to the gymnasium.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:23.31,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,It would've been better if they had worn extra clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.31,0:06:24.44,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.43,0:06:28.36,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's drawn really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:30.20,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:32.37,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you see, it's drawn with a lot of effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:40.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey you, everyone has gone to the gymnasium.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:42.84,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:44.55,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.55,0:06:46.39,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to be scolded by my teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.39,0:06:48.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:51.51,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,So cute! How many months?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.51,0:06:54.13,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,She's almost tenth months.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:57.14,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it great, a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:00.77,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,How nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:07.08,Default,Mom2,0000,0000,0000,,Speaking of which, my kid caught the flu last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.53,0:07:07.74,Default-Alt,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.74,0:07:09.25,Default-Alt,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:09.81,Default,Mom3,0000,0000,0000,,Really? It must've been hard on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.81,0:07:11.37,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's already that season?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:13.97,Default,Mom3,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you have them rest for another two days after the fever subsides?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:14.95,Default,Mom3,0000,0000,0000,,To prevent spreading?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.13,0:07:20.12,Default,Mom2,0000,0000,0000,,I sent my kid back to school immediately after the fever was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.12,0:07:21.75,Default,Mom3,0000,0000,0000,,I guess that can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:23.63,Default,Mom3,0000,0000,0000,,You'll risk your job if you take too much time off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:28.10,Default,Mom2,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, he's mostly recovered, and the virus is gone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:29.40,Default,Mom3,0000,0000,0000,,That's also true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:33.89,Default,Mom2,0000,0000,0000,,Furthermore, if it really does spread to others, they won't know who they caught it from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.80,0:07:39.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:47.97,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:53.92,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, it's not that I totally don't understand what they're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:57.49,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I feel even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:08:01.65,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,What they said just now about affecting their jobs; I actually feel the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.65,0:08:03.96,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:08.24,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I start feeling anxious the moment the weather becomes colder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:10.59,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,But Kouki, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:13.30,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and put on your pyjamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.19,0:08:19.78,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Though, when the weather turns warmer after winter,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:22.08,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I feel relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.99,0:08:24.94,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:33.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! We're going to get our backpacks, so wait for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:35.29,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are both of you idiots!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:36.28,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, your nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:39.60,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I tell you the gym is cold, and that you need {want }to wear extra clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:41.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And also, don't run in the hallway!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:42.96,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:45.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I said, don't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:51.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki has started growing his permanent teeth, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:54.72,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,We live in an apartment building, but he still insists on tossing it to the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.72,0:08:58.55,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,He doesn't listen to me at all, recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.55,0:09:02.39,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have the right to comment on this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.39,0:09:04.73,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not wearing much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:07.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sprinting down the stairs two steps at a time at full speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:10.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Gobbling down my food, and drinking my milk in one gulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:14.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I have to stop kids from doing the things I've done before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:16.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It feels weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:19.10,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Did you really do all those things before, Daikichi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:21.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Most boys would have done them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:25.91,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I should say, looking at Kouki reminds me of myself when I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:32.23,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, but I didn't expect you to behave like that in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.23,0:09:34.84,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I feel at ease after hearing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:38.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,W-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:43.80,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.80,0:09:44.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Walk together with Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:45.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't wanna~
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:49.52,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Then, let's split into a boy's team and a girl's team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:50.69,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't wanna~
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:54.45,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan's face looks slightly flushed.{It's been a while since I've seen this usage, sankyu Avid :3 -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.45,0:09:55.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.78,0:10:02.45,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan probably has a fever. {熱 netsu = fever/temperature}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.09,0:10:06.62,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,It may even become a high fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.62,0:10:08.09,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:13.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It looks much redder than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.79,0:10:25.61,Default,Doctor,0000,0000,0000,,It shouldn't be influenza.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:29.39,Default,Doctor,0000,0000,0000,,But it's still safer for the family members to wear a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.34,0:10:31.96,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.96,0:10:33.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:34.86,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:46.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you full already?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.12,0:10:49.96,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I feel something around here{my heart}...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:54.17,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The doctor said it's stomach bug, so don't force yourself to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:57.40,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like something...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.40,0:10:58.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.47,0:11:01.14,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'll go get a wash basin! {Please condense if line too short, thanks. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:24.55,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}What? Rin-chan has a fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:26.20,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Call the ambulance immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:29.71,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}No, I've already taken her to the doctor and got a prescription.{In this context, "prescription" means both permission to get medicine, and the medicine itself.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.71,0:11:31.42,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}But she doesn't want to eat them at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.73,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Her temperature is increasing, and she seems to be suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.73,0:11:36.23,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}You must have given her too few clothes to wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.23,0:11:38.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Talking about this now won't solve anything.{It doesn't solve anything talking about this now.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:41.10,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Have you tried dissolving it in fruit juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.10,0:11:44.45,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You used to drink it all at once, as long as I added something sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.67,0:11:47.14,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.14,0:11:48.39,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:12:00.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, try it. It's really sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:03.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Now, have a mouthful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:09.58,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:39.64,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse us for coming here so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:41.45,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,How is she doing, Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:43.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:44.14,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Can I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.14,0:12:46.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.14,0:12:47.41,Default-Alt,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! What's with your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.91,0:12:52.75,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It isn't the flu though...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:55.50,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, go over there and watch TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:56.41,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,OK~
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.41,0:12:57.38,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make much noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.81,0:13:03.84,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She only just fell asleep recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.55,0:13:13.03,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Her temperature kept increasing, and she couldn't get to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.03,0:13:15.18,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Also, she didn't sweat at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.18,0:13:17.44,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Did you give her something to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.43,0:13:22.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She should at least have a sports drink.{isotonic drinks}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.00,0:13:24.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But she isn't drinking or eating anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.40,0:13:26.03,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What exactly should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:29.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,W-What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.33,0:13:33.41,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,You must maintain composure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.37,0:13:40.63,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,An adult has to be calm and assure the child that she will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.63,0:13:42.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.74,0:13:45.22,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen Rin like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:47.93,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Don't say that; you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.93,0:13:54.01,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,When children really get into trouble, they'll stick close to those they think can help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.49,0:14:02.15,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan will be fine as long as you're by her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.46,0:14:08.86,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.03,0:14:12.33,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:14.65,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Are you thirsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:16.29,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to try eating ice cubes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.43,0:14:33.60,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:39.60,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:41.36,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.36,0:14:43.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I went to the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.57,0:14:45.28,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.28,0:14:48.20,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.27,0:14:52.95,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,You can try eating ice cubes again later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:56.52,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Your stomach won't be able to take it if you eat too much at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:57.75,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:05.63,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,The ice cubes that are freezing now are sweet and delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.83,0:15:07.97,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.47,0:15:17.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry. You're going to be late for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:19.73,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan is really fighting hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.73,0:15:23.69,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,She'll be all right as long as you are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.69,0:15:26.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:29.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you too, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.32,0:15:40.26,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My bad, I may have to take leave tomorrow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.26,0:15:42.29,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Give me a call if there's anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.29,0:15:43.82,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.82,0:15:45.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry to trouble all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.82,0:15:47.53,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What're you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.53,0:15:49.80,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, just leave everything here to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:51.89,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Arigatou.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.01,0:16:05.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna eat something?{Are you able to eat something?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.64,0:16:06.72,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:18.41,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So you eat only sweet stuff after catching a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:24.87,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll eat the rest later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.59,0:16:29.51,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.06,0:16:39.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You'll feel better after sleeping a while more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.14,0:16:48.06,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why did it have to be Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.06,0:16:51.71,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This kind of cold would be nothing to me if I were the one who caught it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.71,0:16:56.07,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1180)}Dammit, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.55,0:17:16.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:19.78,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Hey~~!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.78,0:17:21.85,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:31.38,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,How are you, Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:32.82,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Does it hurt anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.83,0:17:35.78,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:39.70,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to prepare you delicious porridge now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.96,0:17:59.08,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Her temperature started rising again from the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:18:00.22,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.22,0:18:03.81,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,The normal body temperature is also lower in the morning, but starts rising in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.81,0:18:07.67,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But she went over 39 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.81,0:18:07.67,Note,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Note: 39°C = 102.2°F = 312.15K
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:10.15,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,OK, put all these inside the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.15,0:18:11.23,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:15.46,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.27,0:18:21.78,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.29,0:18:27.79,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Water...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:37.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It looks really tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:39.55,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I also made some for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:44.14,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Rin wants water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.14,0:18:45.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.16,0:18:53.94,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, you might catch it, so don't come in, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.67,0:18:56.48,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine if I catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.48,0:18:58.98,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How can that be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.15,0:19:04.40,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:09.71,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.44,0:19:20.81,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.81,0:19:24.10,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin also feels really at ease when you're around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.07,0:19:32.67,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:33.98,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Have some of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.44,0:19:38.14,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:41.29,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki also eats this when he is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.29,0:19:43.91,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,This is a special porridge that will make your illness go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:46.83,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun also?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:48.10,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.10,0:19:52.58,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,He gets better immediately after finishing eating this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:05.26,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.91,0:20:13.81,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:29.95,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, are you feeling better already?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.95,0:20:32.08,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, {\alpha&FFFFFF&}I feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:33.96,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.82,0:20:53.02,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.99,0:22:29.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Can you help me thank your mom for her time?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.52,0:22:31.16,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.16,0:22:34.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank her for coming over to take care of Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.12,0:22:38.50,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,About that... can I go with the two of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:40.06,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:43.55,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,According to the rules, only your mom can come and pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.90,0:22:47.84,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,She caught a cold and is resting at home, my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.84,0:22:48.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.88,0:22:50.09,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:49.07,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k9}{\k13}a{\k52}shi{\k45}ta {\k18}no {\k22}ko{\k25}to {\k21}ha {\k20}{\k20}wa{\k29}ka{\k17}n{\k9}na{\k10}i
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:49.07,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k9}{\k65}明{\k45}日{\k18}の{\k22}こ{\k25}と{\k21}は{\k20}{\k20}わ{\k29}か{\k17}ん{\k9}な{\k10}い。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:49.07,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know what's going to happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.07,0:00:54.20,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k22}{\k22}ko{\k53}re{\k32}tte {\k14}gi{\k48}se{\k19}i {\k21}to{\k41}ha {\k31}chi{\k23}ga{\k19}u.{\k18} {\k24}na{\k18}ni{\k24}ka {\k18}ga {\k25}chi{\k19}ga{\k22}u.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.07,0:00:54.20,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k22}{\k22}こ{\k53}れ{\k32}って{\k14}ギ{\k48}セ{\k19}イ{\k21}と{\k41}は{\k54}違{\k19}う。{\k18}{\k42}何{\k24}か{\k18}が{\k44}違{\k22}う。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.07,0:00:54.20,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,This is different from sacrificing. Very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:57.91,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k22}{\k19}ba{\k26}tsu{\k22}ge{\k23}e{\k21}mu {\k20}ja{\k18}n, {\k27}na{\k17}n{\k11}te {\k10}o{\k27}mo{\k35}wa{\k49}na{\k24}i.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:57.91,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k22}{\k45}罰{\k22}ゲ{\k23}ー{\k21}ム{\k20}じゃ{\k18}ん、{\k27}な{\k17}ん{\k11}て{\k37}思{\k35}わ{\k49}な{\k24}い。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:57.91,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think this is a punishment game either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.91,0:01:01.08,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k17}{\k21}de, {\k24}na{\k21}n{\k41}de {\k22}na{\k21}no{\k24}ka {\k22}wa{\k37}{\k32}ka{\k13}n{\k24}nai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.91,0:01:01.08,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k17}{\k21}で、{\k24}な{\k21}ん{\k41}で{\k22}な{\k21}の{\k24}か{\k22}わ{\k37}{\k32}か{\k13}ん{\k12}な{\k12}い。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.91,0:01:01.08,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm not really sure what it is. {Grammar Check Please}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:04.33,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k16}{\k47}cho{\k25}tto {\k37}sha{\k24}ku{\k25}ze{\k12}n {\k16}to {\k33}shi{\k22}na{\k20}i {\k25}ke{\k23}do,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:04.33,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k16}{\k47}ちょ{\k25}っと{\k61}釈{\k37}然{\k16}と{\k33}し{\k22}な{\k20}い{\k25}け{\k23}ど、
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:04.33,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, I do feel quite troubled,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:10.50,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k38}{\k23}ki{\k20}mi {\k20}no {\k32}so{\k18}n{\k23}za{\k13}i, {\k25}{\k22}i{\k21}ma {\k25}da{\k19}i{\k22}ji {\k40}da, {\k30}na{\k14}n{\k21}te{\k25}mo{\k10}n{\k29}ja{\k61}na{\k39}i.{\k23}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:10.50,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k38}{\k23}き{\k20}み{\k20}の{\k50}存{\k36}在、{\k25}{\k22}い{\k21}ま{\k44}大{\k22}事{\k40}だ、{\k30}な{\k14}ん{\k21}て{\k25}も{\k10}ん{\k29}じゃ{\k61}な{\k39}い。{\k23}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:10.50,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Your existence is no longer so important anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.50,0:01:16.63,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k20}{\k24}o{\k26}wa{\k22}ra{\k27}na{\k17}i {\k41}ko{\k41}to {\k36}na{\k12}n{\k16}te {\k24}ko{\k18}no{\k41}yo {\k27}no {\k20}do{\k40}ko{\k27}ni{\k20}mo{\k66}na{\k44}i.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.50,0:01:16.63,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k20}{\k24}終{\k26}わ{\k22}ら{\k27}な{\k17}い{\k41}こ{\k41}と{\k36}な{\k12}ん{\k16}て{\k24}こ{\k18}の{\k41}世{\k27}の{\k20}何{\k40}処{\k27}に{\k20}も{\k66}無{\k44}い。
